[07:22:03.664] ℹ️  # send_message_to_agent — Send Message

Send a message to another agent (lead or worker) in the same channel via the channel mailbox (routed to the recipient's own mailbox). Use priority "immediate" for urgent real-time messages that the recipient sees instantly during work; use "task" (default) for messages that queue until the recipient finishes their current task. Set require_reply=true to demand a response: the recipient must reply with their result via this same tool. When replying to a message, pass its message_id as in_reply_to — replies are auto-upgraded to real-time delivery and pushed straight into the recipient's running session, so the answer reaches a waiting sender instantly.

